OL,3,GNEWSAStormont 'failing to plan' for
OL,4,Aageing population
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's leaders have not
OL,7,Fabsorbed the implications of a rapidly
OL,8,Fageing society and are continuing to
OL,9,F"plan for a population from a previous
OL,10,Fera" the Commissioner for Older People
OL,11,FSiobhan Casey has warned.
OL,13,FIn a new report, Casey said: "The
OL,14,Fageing population is here, whether we
OL,15,Fare ready for it or not."
OL,17,FThe report draws on official population
OL,18,Fprojections which suggest that next
OL,19,Fyear the number of people aged over 65
OL,20,Fwill overtake the number of children.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
