OL,3,GNEWSAStormont 'failing to plan' for
OL,4,Aageing population
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's population as a
OL,7,Fwhole is projected to fall slightly
OL,8,Fover the next 25 years but the
OL,9,Fpopulation aged over 65 is projected to
OL,10,Fincrease by almost 45%.
